	quest.519B6CD5483BDA32.quest_subtitle: "种植。收获。重复。"
	quest.519B6CD5483BDA32.title: "木材种子"
	quest.519C6E8B455FFFB5.quest_desc: [
		"&7&eInscriber&7 使用陨石压机将电路刻印在金、钻石、纯 Certus 和硅上。"
