		""
		"&7Place a &bSeawater Pump&7 in an ocean biome. Now you can literally suck the ocean dry for profit."
	]
	quest.7A1B2C3D4E5F6008.quest_subtitle: "盐业工业"
	quest.7A1B2C3D4E5F6008.title: "&9&l海洋抽取器&r"
	quest.7A1B2C3D4E5F600B.quest_desc: ["&7处理海水以获得&c溴&7。它有毒，有臭味，而且非常有用。"]
	quest.7A1B2C3D4E5F600B.quest_subtitle: "臭烘烘的水"
	quest.7A1B2C3D4E5F600B.title: "&c&l溴提取&r"
	quest.7A1B2C3D4E5F600C.quest_desc: ["&7Inject &cBromine&7 into your veins so you don't burn to death. Lava is just spicy water now."]
	quest.7A1B2C3D4E5F600C.quest_subtitle: "辛辣之水免疫效果"
	quest.7A1B2C3D4E5F600C.title: "&c&l防火剂&r"
	quest.7A1B2C3D4E5F600D.quest_desc: [
		"&7&aRadiation Irradiator&7 使用原始辐射将材料转化为全新的同位素。"
		""
		"&7把物品放进去，用中子轰击它们，希望别长出第三条胳膊。"
