	quest.7AD9D28587F43CE0.title: "&7&l风力剪切符文&r"
	quest.7AEC615CA22DC5F7.quest_desc: [
		"&6A capstone. Everything before this was preparation.&r"
		""
		"制作或获取 &6Module Inhalation Purification Unit&r。"
		"升级模块。将它们放入插槽中，无需重建整个装置，即可将普通机器升级为高速机器。"
